---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { BRAND_EMAIL } from '../lib/brand';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="About Us — Pickraft"
  description="Learn about Pickraft — free online image tools that run in your browser. No signup, no uploads to our servers."
  canonical="/about"
  heading="About Us"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">What is Pickraft?</h2>
    <p>
      Pickraft is a collection of free online image tools — format converters, an image compressor,
      HEIC to JPG conversion, and image to PDF — built for anyone who needs to work with images
      quickly without installing software or creating an account.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Our approach</h2>
    <p>
      Every tool on Pickraft runs locally in your browser. When you convert, compress, or combine
      images, your files stay on your device. We do not upload your images to our servers, store
      them, or access them. That privacy-first design is central to how we build every feature.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">What we offer</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">Pickraft includes tools for common image tasks, including:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>Converting between JPG, PNG, and WebP</li>
      <li>Converting HEIC photos from iPhone and Apple devices to JPG</li>
      <li>Compressing images with lossy or lossless quality control</li>
      <li>Combining multiple images into a single PDF document</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">
      All tools are free to use with no watermarks and no limits on how often you can convert.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Who it's for</h2>
    <p>
      Pickraft is for students, professionals, photographers, web developers, and anyone who needs a
      fast image tool on Windows, Mac, iPhone, or Android. Open the site in your browser, upload
      your files, and download the result — no app store download required.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Questions or feedback</h2>
    <p>
      We'd like to hear from you. Visit our
      <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:underline">contact page</a>
      or email
      <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_EMAIL}`} class="text-link hover:underline">{BRAND_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
